Step 1: Verify Java and Maven
java -version
mvn -version


Step 2: Navigate to the experiment directory
cd ~/Projects/devopsexp


Step 3: Generate the Karate project
mvn archetype:generate \
-DarchetypeGroupId=com.intuit.karate \
-DarchetypeArtifactId=karate-archetype \
-DarchetypeVersion=1.4.1 \
-DgroupId=com.example \
-DartifactId=karate-demo \
-DinteractiveMode=false


Step 4: Navigate to the project
cd ~/Projects/devopsexp/karate-demo
ls


Step 5: Execute the test cases
mvn test -Dtest=examples.users.UsersRunner


Step 6: Verify the results
The successful execution showed:
Tests run: 2
Failures: 0
Errors: 0
Skipped: 0
BUILD SUCCESS


Step 7: Open the HTML report
From Ubuntu, run:
explorer.exe "$(wslpath -w target/karate-reports/karate-summary.html)"


This command launches the HTML report in your Windows browser from the Ubuntu terminal.
